data: {"letter":"B","label":"MatMul (Q · Kᵀ)","text":"one dot product of the query with each key","kind":"step","after":["A"],"edge":[null],"cite":{"citation_id":"cit_01M536X6EXEN0HTWMHCXJEPZRR","quote":"We compute the dot products of the query with all keys","anchor":{"anchorVersion":1,"offsetUnit":"unicode","id":"cit_01M536X6EXEN0HTWMHCXJEPZRR","doc":{"paperId":"ppr_G9AYN750E5MG1NRBMGSQJ4N5JM","pdfSha256":"sha256:bdfaa68d8984f0dc02beaca527b76f207d99b666d31d1da728ee0728182df697","parserVersion":"1.0.0","textStreamId":"api/ppr_G9AYN750E5MG1NRBMGSQJ4N5JM/g1/1.0.0"},"targetKind":"citation","provenanceClass":"source","selectors":[{"type":"BlockSelector","blockId":"blk_bpxexqwrbbgi5ca3","blockTextHash":"sha256:76aa2febf6ee3abc266c15918b0d5cd20f4cd8b8a201eedaaae4c35482388196"},{"type":"PageSelector","index":3},{"type":"TextPositionSelector","start":9299,"end":9600},{"type":"TextQuoteSelector","exact":"We call our particular attention \"Scaled Dot-Product Attention\" (Figure 2). The input consists of\nqueries and keys of dimension dk, and values of dimension dv. We compute the dot products of the\nquery with all keys, divide each by √dk, and apply a softmax function to obtain the weights on the\nvalues.","prefix":" with the corresponding key.\n3.2.1\nScaled Dot-Product Attention\n","suffix":"\nIn practice, we compute the attention function on a set of queries","exactNormalised":"wecallourparticularattention\"scaleddot-productattention\"(figure2).theinputconsistsofqueriesandkeysofdimensiondk,andvaluesofdimensiondv.wecomputethedotproductsofthequerywithallkeys,divideeachby√dk,andapplyasoftmaxfunctiontoobtaintheweightsonthevalues.","prefixNormalised":"withthecorrespondingkey.3.2.1scaleddot-productattention","suffixNormalised":"inpractice,wecomputetheattentionfunctiononasetofqueries"},{"type":"ShapeSelector","pageIndex":3,"quads":[[107.53199768066406,370.5111535870824,504.0005187988281,412.2119191613486]],"polygons":[[[503.9967346191406,370.5111535870824],[503.9967346191406,38